# Identity-looking columns this adapter is allowed to keep. Checked in CI by openpak/.github scripts/dedup-lint.py.
# One entry per line: table.column  # reason. Every entry needs a reason. Caches are also watched nightly by
# openpak-dedup-check (md5 compare against the account core, board card openpak/prds#131).
principal_basic_info.username  # NEX friends wire field; cache resolved from nn-account/core, watched by openpak-dedup-check
mii.name  # NEX friends Mii block; cache of the core Mii, watched by openpak-dedup-check
network_account_info.birthday  # NEX friends wire field (packed); cache of the core birthday, watched by openpak-dedup-check
